# Kept minimal deliberately: `turbo prune` in apps/api/Dockerfile needs the
# real pnpm-lock.yaml and workspace package.json files to compute an
# accurate pruned subset, so nothing workspace-related is excluded here.
# This only strips what a build never needs to read.

node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/cdk.out
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
